  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "Thank you for calling VeloFit. Your call may be recorded for quality assurance. Please hold for the next available agent.",
      "speakerId": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "role": "AUTOMATED_AGENT",
      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684597000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. You've reached VeloFit, my name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684605266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I need to return something.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684611466666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. May I have your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684613466666
    },
    {
      "text": "Mark Peterson. Order 7-8-6-5-5-3.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684619399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you, Mark. I see you're calling about the Spin Class Shoes. To make sure I understand, what specifically is the issue with them? Is it a technical fault or more of a preference?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684621799999
    },
    {
      "text": "They're just not right. They're giving me blisters and I can't seem to get the cleats adjusted properly. I just want to send them back.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684634199999
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm sorry to hear that the cycling shoes are causing blisters; that's definitely not the experience we want for our customers. Let me just confirm the purchase date... One moment.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684643399999
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684655533332
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, I see the delivery was 73 days ago. You're well within our 90-day return window, so I can definitely process this for you.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684656233332
    },
    {
      "text": "Great. So you're just going to do it?",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684664966665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, of course. I've just approved the return. You'll receive an email with a pre-paid shipping label within the next 15 minutes. Once we receive the shoes back at our warehouse, a full refund will be issued to your original payment method.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684667633331
    },
    {
      "text": "Whatever. I guess that's the least you could do. It took long enough.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 49029,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684683833331
    },
    {
      "text": "I understand. I'm glad we could get this sorted out for you. Is there anything else I can assist you with today, Mark?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1766684688633331
    },
    {
      "text": "No. Just send the email.",
